#: ../app/ui/PodcastsTab.qml:127
msgid ""
"You haven't subscribed to any podcasts yet, visit the 'Find New Podcasts' "
"page to add some."
msgstr ""
"Cha do rinn thu fo-sgrìobhadh gu pod-chraoladh fhathast, tadhail air an "
"duilleag \"Lorg pod-chraolaidhean ùra\" gus fear no dhà a chur ris."

